{"8":[{"k":"p","t":"after the fuel indicator reaches zero. The player can only get one bonus for each 300 fuel units he buys."},{"k":"p","t":"The coin accumulator keeps track of the coins a player has spent. STARFIRE maintains twenty high scores: \u2018one for players who have only inserted one coin, asecond for two-coin players, and so on. Players who spend more than twenty coins are lumped together in the twenty-coin score."},{"k":"h","t":"When a player finishes playing, STARFIRE counts the"},{"k":"p","t":"coins he has spent and compares his point score to the appropriate high score. If he has topped that score, the game asks him for his initials (one, two, or three letters); as long as his high score stands, his initials will be on the attract mode score table. If switch 7 of the DIP switch is ON, the score table will stay on screen as long as the laser fire button is pressed (see Section IV, Operator Adjustments)."},{"k":"p","t":"Every third coin a player spends buys double playtime. That is, STARFIRE awards four coins worth of playtime for each three coins spent."},{"k":"p","t":"IV. OPERATOR ADJUSTMENTS"},{"k":"h","t":"A. Selectable Options"},{"k":"p","t":"The AUDIO VOLUME CONTROL is located at 8A on the daughter PC board (see Figure 10). All game options are selected by setting the 8-position DIP switch (located"},{"k":"h","t":"at 3A on the daughter PC board). The figure below shows"},{"k":"p","t":"which switches contro! which options."},{"k":"p","t":"1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8"},{"k":"p","t":"ON"},{"k":"p","t":"OFF"},{"k":"p","t":"ve"},{"k":"h","t":"COINS TO START"},{"k":"h","t":"FUEL PER COIN"},{"k":"p","t":"BONUS |"},{"k":"h","t":"SCORE TABLE HOLD"},{"k":"p","t":"MODE"},{"k":"p","t":"FIGURE 5. 8-POSITION DIP SWITCH Time of Play (tor each 300 fuel units)"},{"k":"tr","t":"switch   switch   seconds"},{"k":"p","t":"1 2"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   off   60"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   off   70"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   on   80"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   on   90"},{"k":"p","t":"Coins to Start & Fuel per Coin"},{"k":"tr","t":"switch   switch   coinsto   \u2014_fuel units"},{"k":"tr","t":"3   4   start   per coin"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   off   1   300"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   on   1   600"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   off   2   150"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   on   2   300"},{"k":"p","t":"Bonus"},{"k":"p","t":"switch switch points needed 5 6 for bonus"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   off   300"},{"k":"tr","t":"on   off   500"},{"k":"tr","t":"off   on   700"},{"k":"p","t":"on on no bonus"},{"k":"p","t":"\u2018Score Table Hold (length of time score table is shown during attract mode)"},{"k":"p","t":"switch time"},{"k":"p","t":"off fixed length"},{"k":"p","t":"on fixed length, plus as long fire button is held"}],"23":[{"k":"li","t":"1. Wiring Harness Pinout Table"},{"k":"h","t":"Harness Connector From To Wire Signal"},{"k":"tr","t":"Power Supply | J1 (3-pin   Jt   J2-4   18\u201d black 18 ga"},{"k":"tr","t":"AC input   maie Molex)   Hot"},{"k":"tr","t":"Jat   J14-4   33\" black 18 ga"},{"k":"tr","t":"J1-2   J2-2   18\" white 18 ga"},{"k":"p","t":"Ground"},{"k":"tr","t":"J1-2   J14-2   33\u201d white 18 ga"},{"k":"tr","t":"J1-3   J2-3   18\" green 22 ga"},{"k":"p","t":"Earth ground"},{"k":"tr","t":"J1-3   J14-3   33\u201d green 22 ga"},{"k":"tr","t":"Light Harness | J2 (3-pin   J2-1   E3-1   51\" black 18 ga   Hot"},{"k":"p","t":"AC input female"},{"k":"tr","t":"Molex)   J2-2   E3-2   39\u201d white 18 ga   Ground"},{"k":"tr","t":"Main Harness   J3 (12-pin   J3-1   Je12   40\" black 18 ga   Ground"},{"k":"p","t":"Power Supply | male Molex)"},{"k":"tr","t":"Output   J3-2   S122   63's\" yel-org 18 ga"},{"k":"p","t":"+12 VDC audio"},{"k":"tr","t":"J3-2   J12-3   63's\" yel-org 18 ga"},{"k":"tr","t":"J3-3   Jat   68\" yellow 18 ga"},{"k":"p","t":"+12 VDC logic"},{"k":"tr","t":"J3-3   Je-11   40\u201d yellow 18 ga"},{"k":"tr","t":"J3-4   J6-10   40\" brown 18 ga"},{"k":"p","t":"\u20145 VDC"},{"k":"tr","t":"J34   J4-5   68\" brown 18 ga"},{"k":"tr","t":"J3-5   J12-1   63%\" white 18 ga   | \u2